National Economic and Development Authority (NEDA);
Bangko Sentaral ng Pilipinas (BSP); and
Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC)
The agencies enumerated above shall have at least one (1) permanent
representative each with a rank not lower than Director. Other concerned
agencies may be invited to join the PCC as may be necessary and appropriate.
The DFA Undersecretary for International Economic Relations and the DTI
Undersecretary for International Trade shall act as co-chairs of the PCC. The
DTI Undersecretary shall convene and conduct the meetings of the PCC In
his/her absence, the DA Undersecretary may also convene and conduct the
meetings of the PCC.
